WEBVTT

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

01:32.890 --> 01:34.700
Wh..What is that?

01:34.890 --> 01:36.530
Royalty.

01:36.960 --> 01:39.060
What, you don't know about it, Hiro?

01:39.060 --> 01:40.870
It's a phoenix.

01:41.730 --> 01:44.100
Though it's the first time I've seen one myself.

01:44.100 --> 01:46.080
That's not what I meant!

01:47.070 --> 01:48.840
Beautiful, isn't it?

01:48.840 --> 01:52.150
That's the adult form of Royalty.

01:53.280 --> 01:57.250
When we grow up, we turn into phoenixes,
with eternal life and youth.

01:57.710 --> 01:59.810
It makes sense, if you think about it.

01:59.820 --> 02:03.320
Why do we kill each other before we grow up?

02:03.320 --> 02:05.520
The answer is simple.

02:05.520 --> 02:08.420
Because, once we become adults,

02:08.420 --> 02:13.290
we become fully immortal,
unable to kill each other.

02:13.300 --> 02:15.930
So we have to narrow it down
to one before then.

02:15.930 --> 02:18.730
Otherwise, the kingdom would be in chaos

02:18.730 --> 02:20.540
Even Hime will...

02:30.050 --> 02:32.850
The Elders themselves have
come to the lower world?

02:32.850 --> 02:35.320
If you think you can judge me,

02:35.320 --> 02:37.220
go ahead and try.

02:37.220 --> 02:38.860
Huga.

02:39.690 --> 02:44.360
Isn't the light that purifies the
immortals spectacular?

02:44.360 --> 02:47.600
But if the Royal Family is interfering, then...

02:47.600 --> 02:51.770
The Royal Family are the only ones
who can calm this storm, am I right?

02:53.240 --> 02:55.400
Yes, perhaps you are.

02:55.400 --> 03:00.170
They've come to conceal everything
by cooperating with the human world.

03:00.180 --> 03:02.490
But they need to settle everything first.

03:04.080 --> 03:07.530
The Royal Family will handle this case?

03:08.220 --> 03:10.030
Very well then.

03:10.290 --> 03:12.550
I will go along with it.

03:32.970 --> 03:35.580
It's just like Sherwood said

03:35.580 --> 03:38.220
What happened in that town is being concealed.

03:38.810 --> 03:40.450
Also,

03:40.450 --> 03:44.160
since it happened, Hime's been acting funny.

03:47.420 --> 03:49.060
Hime...

03:54.030 --> 03:55.160
Flandre.

03:55.160 --> 03:56.430
Huga.

03:56.430 --> 03:59.170
Don't worry about me.

04:00.240 --> 04:02.550
Just go and charge yourself up to 100%.

04:02.840 --> 04:04.480
Huga.

04:04.610 --> 04:07.250
Ms. Sawawa... Ms. Sawawa...

04:09.680 --> 04:11.250
It doesn't taste good, does it?

04:11.980 --> 04:14.250
My newly-created seafood parfait?

04:14.250 --> 04:17.130
Oh, it's delicious.

04:17.650 --> 04:21.060
I see. Then, is something on your mind?

04:21.060 --> 04:24.040
Yes, actually, I'm lonely.

04:25.190 --> 04:29.110
The Mistress hasn't been eating much lately.

04:29.800 --> 04:32.370
She just stays locked up in her room.

04:32.370 --> 04:36.740
And it's not just her.
Hiro and the others, too.

04:36.740 --> 04:40.780
I son of feel left out.

04:40.780 --> 04:42.180
That's...

04:42.180 --> 04:43.810
I feel uneasy in my chest.

04:43.810 --> 04:45.250
Chest?!

04:45.250 --> 04:49.350
Whenever I have a bad feeling,
it usually comes true.

04:55.820 --> 04:59.090
2513, 2514, 25...

04:59.090 --> 05:01.730
2513, 2514, 25...

05:01.730 --> 05:03.200
Did you say something?

05:03.200 --> 05:06.530
Don't be all grumpy because
Hiro's feeling down.

05:06.540 --> 05:08.040
That's not it!

05:08.040 --> 05:09.000
2519, 2520

05:09.000 --> 05:12.470
The princess won't come out of her room.
How boring.

05:14.080 --> 05:16.210
You just ran away from the battle!

05:16.440 --> 05:18.950
Where do you get off preaching to me?

05:32.790 --> 05:34.770
That's the Royal Family's...

05:34.960 --> 05:36.770
Imperial Guard.

05:46.310 --> 05:49.290
Hiro, I'm stepping out for a bit.

05:50.150 --> 05:52.130
Guard the mansion while I'm out.

05:52.550 --> 05:54.320
Hime...

05:54.320 --> 05:56.280
You're going to arrest Hime?!

05:56.280 --> 05:59.790
For the crime of deploying zombies.

05:59.790 --> 06:01.090
We have a warrant.

06:01.090 --> 06:04.730
Wait a sec! You've got it all wrong!

06:04.730 --> 06:06.990
Hime didn't deploy the zombies!

06:07.000 --> 06:08.980
One of her brothers in the Royal Family did!

06:09.460 --> 06:11.600
Stand down, werewolf girl!

06:11.600 --> 06:14.410
We are only carrying out our orders.

06:15.240 --> 06:17.710
Well, shall we get going?

06:17.710 --> 06:19.340
Hime!

06:20.640 --> 06:23.620
I have a hunch as to who accused me.

06:25.210 --> 06:26.850
Princess...

06:27.650 --> 06:29.150
Hey, Hime...

06:29.150 --> 06:31.950
You are as lovely as we expected, Your Majesty.

06:31.950 --> 06:34.230
Please forgive our transgression.

06:34.690 --> 06:36.500
Your Majesty!

06:37.390 --> 06:40.030
Please be careful.

07:06.550 --> 07:08.420
Don't look so nervous, Hiro.

07:08.420 --> 07:09.420
Eh?

07:09.420 --> 07:11.390
It's embarrassing.

07:11.390 --> 07:15.400
Yeah, but is it really all right for me to be here?

07:15.400 --> 07:17.400
It's perfectly fine, Hiro.

07:17.400 --> 07:20.530
You are a royal soldier who has been
granted the Flame of Life.

07:20.540 --> 07:23.070
A master and their soldier share
one mind and soul.

07:23.070 --> 07:24.570
They share the same destiny.

07:24.570 --> 07:27.850
You follow wherever her fate takes her.

07:29.210 --> 07:31.650
Hey! Stop clinging all over him!

07:31.650 --> 07:32.780
Hey! Could you not touch me
with your filthy paws?

07:37.490 --> 07:39.470
Here comes the plaintiff.

07:44.960 --> 07:47.660
That's Hime's brother.

07:47.660 --> 07:50.700
He sure looks like he's hiding a thing or two.

07:51.670 --> 07:53.650
He's the one...

08:05.010 --> 08:08.650
Long time no see, my beloved younger sister.

08:11.620 --> 08:14.530
Hey! I have something I need to ask you!

08:15.320 --> 08:17.290
Who are you?

08:17.290 --> 08:20.430
Does the name Lobo Wildman ring a bell?

08:22.430 --> 08:26.400
Is that lowly beast your servant?

08:26.670 --> 08:28.910
How the mighty have fallen.

08:29.370 --> 08:32.310
Jerk! Don't avoid the question!

08:32.310 --> 08:33.950
Liza!

08:40.320 --> 08:42.190
That's enough.

08:43.390 --> 08:45.520
I apologize for being late.

08:47.060 --> 08:49.500
Very well, let us begin the proceedings.

08:50.090 --> 08:53.730
Now, Monster Court is in session.

08:57.970 --> 09:03.080
It's obvious that the accused
waged an attack on Prince Zeverin.

09:03.740 --> 09:08.310
The point you must pay attention to here
is the fact that, by their very nature,

09:08.310 --> 09:12.910
deploying zombies is far too dangerous
and henceforth illegal.

09:12.910 --> 09:16.680
It is only logical that the one accused
of waging the attack

09:16.680 --> 09:19.420
would be the one who deployed the zombies!

09:19.420 --> 09:20.390
That is all.

09:22.290 --> 09:24.890
What was that? It was all made up.

09:24.890 --> 09:26.090
You're right.

09:26.090 --> 09:30.800
Prince Zeverin plans to pin all his
crimes onto the princess.

09:30.800 --> 09:32.070
No way...

09:32.070 --> 09:34.870
He planned it all along.

09:34.870 --> 09:37.350
Just look at that unreliable lawyer of hers.

09:37.540 --> 09:40.110
Yeah?

09:40.110 --> 09:41.340
The judge, too.

09:42.680 --> 09:43.610
He looks like he doesn't want to be here.

09:44.910 --> 09:48.650
Hmm? Oh, council.

09:48.650 --> 09:50.520
Ahem...

09:50.520 --> 09:55.020
The evidence presented by the prosecution
thus far has been nothing but hearsay.

09:55.020 --> 09:59.130
Barring any physical evidence, the court
cannot accept these wild accusations.

09:59.130 --> 10:04.130
Furthermore, one year ago, zombies were
released into the defendant's domain,

10:04.270 --> 10:07.640
and as a result, she lost all of her retainers.

10:09.800 --> 10:14.440
The retainers in her Royal Court
were known to be the absolute elite.

10:14.440 --> 10:17.320
She is, in fact, the victim.

10:18.150 --> 10:23.150
We have evidence that states that the defendant
released the zombies secretly

10:23.150 --> 10:24.750
and let them ravage her domain!

10:24.750 --> 10:26.890
It was all a charade!

10:26.890 --> 10:30.190
That is the only logical conclusion
that can be drawn!

10:30.190 --> 10:35.190
Hold on a sec, you can't prove she did it,
and you can't prove she didn't.

10:36.100 --> 10:40.570
These accusations require evidence
that proves it beyond a reasonable doubt.

10:40.570 --> 10:42.770
My logic is flawless!

10:42.770 --> 10:44.670
Now wait just a minute!

10:44.670 --> 10:46.440
Your Honor?

10:46.440 --> 10:49.580
Hmm? You may speak.

10:49.580 --> 10:52.680
I am prepared to fight her in this trial,

10:52.680 --> 10:55.580
no matter how many years it takes to
gather the necessary evidence.

10:55.580 --> 10:57.080
However...

10:57.090 --> 11:00.920
Your Honor, you may know this,

11:00.920 --> 11:04.120
but we are of the Royal Phoenix Tribe.

11:04.130 --> 11:07.900
We run the risk of maturing in the years
this trial takes to conclude.

11:07.900 --> 11:11.000
Phoenixes are immortal and completely inviolable

11:11.000 --> 11:14.280
Who will judge us when that time comes?

11:14.800 --> 11:19.010
He intends to use that to tamper with the case.

11:19.440 --> 11:20.240
You asshole!

11:25.950 --> 11:28.050
I have a suggestion.

11:28.050 --> 11:30.030
A..A suggestion?

11:31.190 --> 11:33.290
That's right, Zeverin.

11:52.740 --> 11:55.080
Who would have thought we would be
talking like this again?

11:55.080 --> 11:58.280
Takes me back to the old days, Lilianne.

11:58.280 --> 12:02.130
I don't care if you're my brother,
no one calls me by that name.

12:02.650 --> 12:06.390
Furthermore, I've never thought
of you as my brother.

12:06.390 --> 12:09.420
Don't be so cold, Lilianne.

12:09.420 --> 12:11.330
It's a lovely name.

12:11.330 --> 12:14.290
I even named my cat after you.

12:14.300 --> 12:19.040
The one you killed rough-housing, Zeverin?

12:19.730 --> 12:22.540
So, they're gonna fight right there?

12:22.740 --> 12:24.370
What is this place?

12:24.370 --> 12:26.440
It's an ancient ruin.

12:26.440 --> 12:30.050
It's an aqueduct the Royal Kingdom
built thousands of years ago.

12:30.410 --> 12:31.680
I smell a foul beast.

12:31.680 --> 12:32.780
What?!

12:32.780 --> 12:35.820
Nice seeing you again, Liza, daughter of Worg.

12:35.820 --> 12:37.460
Keziah!

12:37.590 --> 12:40.960
Meeting here, and not on a battlefield...

12:41.590 --> 12:44.090
I'd have never have thought it.

12:45.730 --> 12:47.540
Watch out, Liza!

12:47.660 --> 12:49.960
There's a vampire behind you!

12:49.960 --> 12:53.430
One of those maggots who have
killed millions of our kind!

12:53.430 --> 12:56.070
Oh, we've got an obnoxious cur!

12:56.070 --> 12:57.600
Stop that, Keziah!

12:57.610 --> 12:59.310
And don't antagonize him, Reiri!

12:59.310 --> 13:00.510
Liza, you traitor!

13:00.510 --> 13:04.380
How dare you defend a vampire
when you, yourself, are a werewolf?!

13:04.380 --> 13:05.780
It's not that!

13:05.780 --> 13:08.260
This isn't the place or the time!

13:09.180 --> 13:11.030
She is correct.

13:11.820 --> 13:14.420
This is a sacred dueling ground.

13:14.420 --> 13:16.160
Stand down, Keziah.

13:16.160 --> 13:17.490
Huga.

13:17.490 --> 13:19.340
Yes, Master Emile.

13:19.960 --> 13:21.330
That's...

13:21.330 --> 13:23.140
A duel...

13:26.930 --> 13:31.270
To be honest, I didn't think
he'd agree to a duel.

13:31.270 --> 13:34.840
I thought it was a system
that was banished long ago.

13:34.840 --> 13:36.810
You were right to think that, Keziah.

13:36.810 --> 13:38.580
However, there are exceptions.

13:38.580 --> 13:39.880
Exceptions?

13:39.880 --> 13:41.210
Yes...

13:41.220 --> 13:45.320
Duels are allowed when both parties
are members of the Royal Family.

13:45.590 --> 13:47.570
It's about to begin, Hiro.

13:49.660 --> 13:52.630
Lobo Wildman? Who's that?

13:52.630 --> 13:55.110
A man who was in my Royal Guard.

13:55.800 --> 13:57.400
Never heard of 'im.

13:57.400 --> 14:02.400
I see, then no one will complain when I kill you.

14:03.040 --> 14:05.020
Princess...

14:18.090 --> 14:19.900
Here I come!

14:22.790 --> 14:24.600
Has it begun?

14:24.690 --> 14:26.330
Princess Sherwood!

14:27.060 --> 14:30.860
My brother Emile and I
were chosen to witness the duel.

14:30.870 --> 14:33.400
Nice to see you again, Emile!

14:34.640 --> 14:39.140
Is that you, Sherwood?
You've grown since I last saw you

14:39.140 --> 14:41.640
You look good yourself.

14:45.680 --> 14:47.680
Pray, Hiro.

14:48.750 --> 14:51.320
My sister is at a disadvantage in this fight.

14:53.420 --> 14:56.530
She wants to get revenge on Zeverin, our brother.

14:57.230 --> 15:02.770
Because of him, she lost all of her retainers.

15:15.480 --> 15:18.680
Do you understand the
repercussions of this, Hiro?

15:18.680 --> 15:20.480
I do.

15:20.480 --> 15:23.280
If he's her opponent, then she won't
be able to maintain her composure.

15:23.280 --> 15:26.790
The blood rushes to her head and
she gets flush with emotion!

15:26.790 --> 15:28.860
That's fine for a dog.

15:28.860 --> 15:30.160
What?!

15:30.160 --> 15:35.040
Her greatest strength is her ability
to keep her composure.

15:41.470 --> 15:44.470
But this time is different.

15:44.470 --> 15:49.470
If she loses her composure,
her chances for victory drop dramatically.

15:49.610 --> 15:51.420
No way... Hime...

15:53.210 --> 15:54.850
Hime!

15:58.450 --> 15:59.890
You're weak!

15:59.890 --> 16:03.360
I guess even you are just a girl, Lilianne.

16:08.660 --> 16:10.530
What's with that look?

16:10.530 --> 16:13.700
You think you can still win?!

16:13.700 --> 16:16.770
Give it a shot. This will be fun.

16:16.770 --> 16:19.110
You thought you could win against me!

16:19.110 --> 16:21.110
You called for this duel!

16:21.110 --> 16:22.180
This is bad.

16:22.180 --> 16:23.810
Damn it!

16:26.210 --> 16:28.720
I'm glad, Lilianne.

16:28.720 --> 16:32.060
I get to slice you to bits personally.

16:33.390 --> 16:36.560
And you were the one who gave me
the chance to do so!

16:36.560 --> 16:38.700
What's wrong? Giving up already?

16:39.960 --> 16:41.660
Hime!

16:43.530 --> 16:46.070
Hime! Hime!

16:47.840 --> 16:49.470
Hiro...

16:52.240 --> 16:55.050
Lilianne! You want some more?!

17:00.510 --> 17:03.930
You think you can beat me because
you picked up your sword?

17:05.090 --> 17:08.000
No, I don't even need this.

17:08.690 --> 17:10.460
She cast her own sword down?

17:10.460 --> 17:12.100
Hime!

17:16.160 --> 17:18.640
What are you so scared of?

17:19.270 --> 17:21.470
You've always been like this.

17:21.470 --> 17:22.670
What?

17:22.670 --> 17:26.710
A cheat, and above all else,

17:26.710 --> 17:28.580
a coward.

17:28.580 --> 17:31.710
Stop! D..Don't look at me like that!

17:31.710 --> 17:33.580
Don't look at me like that!

17:33.580 --> 17:36.550
Even Sherwood is prepared to die

17:36.550 --> 17:38.860
This is the fate we were born with.

17:39.520 --> 17:41.330
Don't get any closer!

17:41.960 --> 17:44.160
I said stay back!

17:44.960 --> 17:45.960
Zeverin...

17:45.960 --> 17:48.060
I said stop!

17:48.060 --> 17:49.930
What's the matter, Zeverin?!

17:49.930 --> 17:53.070
Stop it, Lilianne!

17:54.070 --> 17:55.070
AgUn!

17:55.070 --> 17:56.710
Die!

17:58.870 --> 18:00.510
Hime!

18:00.980 --> 18:02.960
You're so predictable, Zeverin!

18:05.910 --> 18:07.710
Lilianne...

18:07.720 --> 18:09.550
You...

18:09.550 --> 18:12.260
To think you'd make the gun misfire...

18:17.560 --> 18:19.200
Lilianne...

18:24.130 --> 18:26.170
Stop it, Franz.

18:26.170 --> 18:30.640
I won't die. I...

18:31.740 --> 18:33.380
...won't...

18:36.680 --> 18:38.320
Huga.

18:44.690 --> 18:46.890
You witnessed the difference in their resolve.

18:52.790 --> 18:54.430
Hime...

18:54.800 --> 18:58.640
Androids share their masters' fate.

18:59.470 --> 19:01.900
Huh? Then, Flandre too?

19:01.900 --> 19:06.770
Flandre would have self-destructed
if my sister had lost.

19:06.770 --> 19:08.880
R. . Really?

19:08.880 --> 19:10.710
Flandre, it's over.

19:10.710 --> 19:12.350
Huga.

19:12.980 --> 19:15.780
Princess Sherwood, the judge!

19:15.780 --> 19:18.220
He confirmed that my sister won.

19:18.220 --> 19:20.620
Not that! He's...

19:20.620 --> 19:23.470
What? You didn't know?

19:23.690 --> 19:26.890
So, the judge was the former king.

19:26.890 --> 19:28.870
It was a special occasion.

19:29.030 --> 19:31.510
We'll meet again, Lilianne.

19:34.040 --> 19:36.350
Sure, if I stay alive.

19:40.980 --> 19:43.110
The former king left.

19:43.110 --> 19:47.220
The immortal soldier quietly vanished, too

19:48.920 --> 19:52.290
Liza! Let's meet again on the battlefield.

19:52.290 --> 19:54.850
You bet! That's what I want!

19:54.860 --> 19:57.700
Farewell, my sisters.
The next time we meet...

19:58.430 --> 20:00.060
We'll do battle.

20:00.060 --> 20:02.010
Emile...

20:02.500 --> 20:04.130
Huga.

20:06.200 --> 20:07.910
Umm, Hime!

20:10.140 --> 20:11.780
Fool.

20:12.570 --> 20:14.550
Let's hurry home, Hiro.

20:15.210 --> 20:16.940
Sawawa is waiting.

20:16.940 --> 20:18.580
Okay!

20:20.180 --> 20:22.720
Ms. Sawawa... Ms. Sawawa...

20:24.990 --> 20:27.550
They haven't returned home yet?

20:27.560 --> 20:30.820
Yes, Hiro's not back yet.

20:30.830 --> 20:34.260
I really think I'm an outcast.

20:34.260 --> 20:38.680
I would never let you be...

20:39.200 --> 20:41.440
Oh, there she is!

20:46.970 --> 20:49.110
Sis, I'm sorry, I...

20:49.110 --> 20:52.010
Hiro! Where did you run off to?

20:52.010 --> 20:53.980
Master, one bowl of curry, please.

20:53.980 --> 20:55.820
I'd like a glass of tomato juice.

20:56.280 --> 20:59.890
Hey, guys! Didn't we just come
here to look for my sister?

20:59.890 --> 21:01.490
Shopkeep!

21:01.490 --> 21:03.620
Get me the most delicious milk you have.

21:05.660 --> 21:08.130
Shopkeep, what are you staring at?

21:08.130 --> 21:12.340
He's all confused...
No, Ryu-Ryu! Don't eat the plants!

21:14.200 --> 21:15.740
Hiro, hurry it up!

21:15.740 --> 21:18.080
Yeah! Okay! Okay!

21:21.440 --> 21:22.710
Hime?

21:22.710 --> 21:23.980
Was Sawawa in there?

21:23.980 --> 21:27.410
Y..Yeah, they told me to get you.

21:27.420 --> 21:29.220
I see.

21:32.250 --> 21:35.590
Oh, I think I really do love Hime.

21:37.090 --> 21:38.290
Humilated, pinned down

21:38.290 --> 21:40.930
By your exquisite and sadistic eyes

21:40.930 --> 21:43.600
I peer into the balance of ecstasy

21:43.600 --> 21:46.330
The shadows of a forlorn exuberance

21:46.330 --> 21:49.170
I explode from the depths of my body

21:49.170 --> 21:51.570
I'm not leaving until I climax

21:51.570 --> 21:51.670
What the hell are you doing?

21:54.640 --> 21:56.810
Oh, Mistress! Flan!

21:56.810 --> 21:56.910
Hiro, you failed in the end, huh?
Oh, Mistress! Flan!

21:59.950 --> 22:01.010
Huga.

22:01.020 --> 22:02.420
Don't you say that

22:02.420 --> 22:04.780
Flan, don't do that.

22:04.790 --> 22:04.880
Go away and drink your tomato juice!

22:06.790 --> 22:07.450
Can you not stand so close to me?

22:09.360 --> 22:10.320
Just tell me exactly how shallow

22:10.320 --> 22:12.760
The creature known as woman truly is?

22:12.760 --> 22:17.760
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.330 --> 22:26.270
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:28.840 --> 22:31.610
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.610 --> 22:34.350
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.350 --> 22:36.920
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:36.920 --> 22:39.550
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.550 --> 22:42.290
Roses fly from my head

22:42.290 --> 22:44.990
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:44.990 --> 22:47.590
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.600 --> 22:50.170
Blood that gushes away

22:50.230 --> 22:52.870
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:52.870 --> 22:55.540
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.540 --> 22:58.200
And yet you're still

22:58.210 --> 23:00.910
Seeking love?

23:00.910 --> 23:03.640
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:03.640 --> 23:06.310
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.310 --> 23:11.310
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.590 --> 23:16.590
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:17.020 --> 23:22.020
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:22.260 --> 23:24.960
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:24.970 --> 23:27.600
But if you still ask for it

23:27.600 --> 23:31.570
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.570 --> 23:39.860
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:41.550 --> 23:42.650
Huga.

23:42.650 --> 23:45.950
I'm gonna be bad, I'm gonna be bad.
I'm gonna be a delinquent!

23:45.950 --> 23:49.190
Watch out! Lay a hand on me and
I'll kick your ass!

23:49.190 --> 23:51.720
You won't know what hit you! Peace!

23:51.730 --> 23:53.060
Huga, huga.

23:53.060 --> 23:55.800
Oh, Hiro, the grass around back needs to be cut.

23:55.900 --> 23:59.070
I'll even kick the grass's ass! Peace!

23:59.070 --> 23:59.700
Huh?

23:59.700 --> 24:00.930
I won't pull any punches!

24:00.940 --> 24:02.740
I'll pull the damn roots out!

24:02.740 --> 24:04.370
Next episode, "Princess Delinquent"

24:04.370 --> 24:05.740
...is what it's called.

24:05.740 --> 24:07.610
Hiro, how old are you?

24:08.340 --> 24:10.750
Huga, huga.
